:Class Circle : ,Shape
⍝ .aplc: another class implementing the same Shape interface.
    :Field Public Radius←1

    ∇ make r
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      Radius←r
    ∇

    ∇ r←Area
      :Implements Method Shape.Area
      r←○Radius*2              ⍝ ○x is π×x
    ∇

    ∇ r←Name
      :Implements Method Shape.Name
      r←'circle'
    ∇
:EndClass
